course: dictionary
lesson: 10536
title: Words about music
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A ukulele is a small instrument with four strings, a bit like a guitar. You can check what a word means by swapping in a word you already know. Try «play the guitar» in place of «play the ukulele» and see if the sentence still makes sense.
explain: «The ukulele grew out of small Portuguese guitars brought to Hawaii.» The word guitars is a clue. The sentence says the ukulele came from guitars, so it must be a similar kind of instrument.
explain: «Fast wobbles sound high and slow wobbles sound low, so a tiny ukulele squeaks and a huge double bass booms.» Look at the pairs: tiny and huge, squeaks and booms. These clues show that a ukulele is small and makes high sounds.
fact: A ukulele is a small, guitar-like instrument with four strings.
fact: The ukulele is also spelled «ukelele», so both spellings are correct.
fact: The ukulele grew out of small Portuguese guitars, brought to Hawaii by immigrants from Madeira in the 1870s and 1880s.
fact: Many schools use the ukulele as a first instrument because it is small, cheap and easy to learn chords on.
fact: Fast wobbles make high sounds, and slow wobbles make low sounds.
exercise: «The ukulele grew out of small Portuguese guitars.» What is a ukulele most like? | A trumpet | A harp | A drum | *A guitar
exercise: What is a ukulele? | A kind of hat from Hawaii | A type of cake | *A small instrument with four strings | A large instrument with six strings
exercise: In «a tiny ukulele squeaks and a huge double bass booms», which word tells you the ukulele is small? | booms | big | *tiny | huge
test: «Fast wobbles sound high and slow wobbles sound low.» Which wobbles make a high sound? | Slow wobbles | *Fast wobbles | Huge wobbles
test: Where was the ukulele developed? | Portugal | Australia | *Hawaii | Madeira
exam: Sam says a ukulele is a huge instrument like a double bass. What is true? | *A ukulele is a small instrument with four strings | A ukulele has six strings like a guitar | A ukulele is a huge instrument | A ukulele booms like a double bass
